    LLM: 'Rotating trumps: ♥-♦-♣-♠-NT cycle. May swap entire hand with Chômeur (first refusal passes right). Follow suit, trump if void. Quota=4 tricks: above=-1pt, below=+1pt. Win all 13=instant win (-9pts).',
